{
 "scratch": "设计两家店卖同款绘本。A店：504元买6本；B店：812元买7本。先估商位数，再算单价比较。A: 5<6, 商2位(84); B: 8>7, 商3位? No, 812/7, 8>7, first digit is hundreds? 8/7=1, so 3 digits. Wait. 812/7 = 116. Yes, 3 digits. 504/6 = 84. 2 digits. Compare 84 vs 116. A is cheaper. This fits the 'estimate digits' knowledge point well because one is 2-digit and one is 3-digit, making estimation very useful for initial comparison.",
 "solver_code": "from decimal import Decimal\ndef solve():\n    # A shop: 504 yuan for 6 books\n    price_a_total = Decimal('504')\n    count_a = 6\n    unit_price_a = price_a_total / count_a\n    \n    # B shop: 812 yuan for 7 books\n    price_b_total = Decimal('812')\n    count_b = 7\n    unit_price_b = price_b_total / count_b\n    \n    # Determine which is cheaper\n    if unit_price_a < unit_price_b:\n        cheaper_shop = \"A店\"\n    else:\n        cheaper_shop = \"B店\"\n        \n    return [unit_price_a, unit_price_b, cheaper_shop]",
 "stem": "两家网店销售同款绘本。A 店 $504$ 元可以买 $6$ 本，B 店 $812$ 元可以买 $7$ 本。\n（1）不计算，估计 A 店和 B 店绘本的单价分别是几位数？\n（2）算一算，哪家店的绘本更便宜？",
 "options": [],
